    "## Stage 2: RapidFuzz candidate generation\n",
    "\n",
    "RapidFuzz is used only after deterministic normalization. Its output is a\n",
    "review queue, not an automatic merge list. Numeric differences and token\n",
    "containment are separated because high lexical similarity can describe a\n",
    "broader family or compound tag instead of an alias."
   ]
  },
