   "source": [
    "## Decision rule\n",
    "\n",
    "Use deterministic normalization for automatic spelling consolidation. Use\n",
    "RapidFuzz to populate a human-review queue. A high fuzzy score is supporting\n",
    "evidence, not authorization to merge two tags.\n",
    "\n",
    "This starting workflow deliberately does not infer descriptor types or broader\n",
    "semantic families. Relationships such as `challenge`, `first time`, and\n",
    "`Yu-Gi-Oh` require a later typed-descriptor stage before broader grouping.\n",
    "\n",
    "The future production mapping should remain versioned and include, at minimum:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "raw_tag -> normalized_tag -> canonical_tag -> broader_group\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "That mapping should be joined through a derived DuckDB view. The original\n",
    "`classification_json` must remain unchanged."
   ]
